Package: nfs-ganesha
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends:
 default-dbus-system-bus | dbus-system-bus,
 libtirpc-common,
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: NFS server in user space (EZGH build)
 NFS-Ganesha is an NFS server running in user space. This is upstream V15.10
 built for EZGH Files gateways: NFSv4 with RPC-with-TLS (OpenSSL, kTLS) and
 per-export QoS, with its bundled ntirpc.
 .
 This package contains ganesha.nfsd and its libraries.

Package: nfs-ganesha-ceph
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Section: libs
Depends:
 libcephfs2 (= 20.2.4-1noble),
 librados2 (= 20.2.4-1noble),
 nfs-ganesha (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: NFS-Ganesha CephFS FSAL and RADOS backends (EZGH build)
 FSAL_CEPH, the rados_kv/rados_ng/rados_cluster recovery backends and RADOS
 URL configuration, built against upstream Ceph 20.2.4 client libraries.
 libcephfs2 uses libceph-common's private symbols from librados2, so this package
 depends on both at exactly the version it was built against.

